Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:08:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] configs: phycore-imx8mm: Add Android 15 defconfigs and
 configuration headers

Add phycore-imx8mm_android_defconfig and phycore-imx8mm_android_uuu_defconfig with GPT/EFI partitioning, MMC RPMB, CONFIG_SPL_OF_TRANSLATE=y, CONFIG_BOOTSTD_FULL=y, and fastboot environment settings.
